  "cik": 1326380,
  "description": {
   "text": "GameStop Corp. (“GameStop,” “we,” “us,” “our,” or the “Company”) offers games, collectibles, and entertainment products through its stores and ecommerce platforms. As we navigate the evolving commercial landscape, our business model is expanding beyond traditional retail to include value creation through disciplined capital allocation. We view our significant cash and other sources of liquidity as a strategic asset to be deployed into acquisitions and control transactions that offer long-term value. Our fiscal year is composed of the 52 or 53 weeks ending on the Saturday closest to the last day of January. Fiscal year 2025 consisted of the 52 weeks ended on January 31, 2026 (\"fiscal 2025\"). Fiscal year 2024 consisted of the 52 weeks ended on February 1, 2025 (\"fiscal 2024\") and fiscal year 2023 consisted of the 53 weeks ended on February 3, 2024 (\"fiscal 2023\").",
